SUMMARY:Classic Car Display
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T150000
UID:2604212_BTexOGkkOn3Wl-n8avZQ
DESCRIPTION:Join us Sunday\, May 3\, for a family-friendly day in Historic
  Railroad Square\, just steps from SMART’s Downtown Santa Rosa station. 
 The Antique Automobile Club of America will roll classic cars into the Cal
 ifornia Welcome Center–Depot Park lot\, where visitors can hear owners
 ’ stories behind their lovingly restored roadsters and vintage innovatio
 ns. Spend the day exploring one of Santa Rosa’s most distinctive histori
 c districts\, with vintage shopping at Whistlestop Antiques\, The Batcave 
 Comics and Toys\, Hot Couture\, and Shangri La Lane. Ride SMART for an eas
 y regional day trip\, or drive and enjoy free Sunday parking. Leashed pets
  are welcome—our Impalas and Wildcats won’t run away. Special thanks t
 o the Antique Automobile Club of America - Redwood Empire Region.
LOCATION:Historic Railroad Square - Depot Park lot
URL:https://www.railroadsquare.net
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
