BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Farm Trails Spring Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T160000
UID:260502lFnqZKORVUOqVbg4z2Q7hQ
DESCRIPTION:Blossoms\, bees\, and barnyard babies: There’s nothing more 
 delightful than springtime along the Sonoma County Farm Trails! Gather up 
 the whole family for our annual Spring Tour on Saturday and Sunday\, May 2
  & 3\, 2026.  \n\nChoose your own agrarian adventure from dozens of farms 
 and producers to discover where your food\, fiber\, and flowers come from.
  Take farm tours\, meet farm animals\, enjoy tastings and workshops\, shop
  for the tastiest ingredients at charming farm stands\, and support local 
 small-scale agriculture while you’re at it. \n\nAll ages are welcome! Re
 gistration is free and easy\, but required to access the insider’s guide
  and interactive map to the tour destinations. Note that not all destinati
 ons will be open both days\; they may also have special hours.
URL:https://www.farmtrails.org/event/farm-trails-spring-tour-3/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mercy's Bingo Smokeout
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T180000
UID:260502bpG_ATmx0E2q-ot4jZdvcA
DESCRIPTION:Numbers. Prizes. Elevated Vibes.\n\nOn Sunday\, May 3rd from 1
 2PM – 6PM\, step into a high-energy twist on a classic favorite inside T
 he Lounge at Mercy.\n\nThis isn’t your average bingo. This is bingo—el
 evated.\n\nCards in hand. Smoke in the air. Energy in the room.\n\nPlay th
 rough multiple bingo rounds throughout the day\, compete for prizes\, and 
 stay locked into an experience that blends cannabis culture with interacti
 ve gameplay from start to finish.\n\nYour ticket includes access to all bi
 ngo sessions\, brand tastings\, exclusive product drops\, and additional g
 ames and activations happening across the space.\n\nOne game. All day. Let
  the numbers hit.\n\nThis is a 420-friendly interactive experience hosted 
 inside our fully licensed cannabis consumption lounge\, where guests can e
 njoy responsibly while participating in gameplay\, tastings\, and activati
 ons. Bingo hits different here.\n\nDate & Time\n\nDate: Sunday\, May 3\, 2
 026\n\nTime: 12:00 PM - 6:00 PM\n\nTickets\n\n$25 — General Admission: E
 ntry to Bingo Smokeout 🎱 Includes access to all bingo rounds and brand 
 tastings.\n\n21\\+ Only | DCC \\# C12-0000420-LIC
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://eventhi.io/events/mercys-bingo-smokeout-5326-14330
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Spring Farm Trails - Bees N Blooms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T160000
UID:26050211804BpnpEqu8NgMBUd3SA
DESCRIPTION:We are so happy to be a part of Sonoma County’s Farm Trails 
 Weekend this Spring\, on Saturday\, May 2nd and Sunday\, May 3rd. Many oth
 er farms will open their doors to the public to celebrate Bees\, Blossoms\
 , and Barnyard Babies. Register with Farm Trails \\(it’s free to registe
 r\\) to access the insider’s guide and interactive map. We will be offer
 ing three different tours here at Bees N Blooms. \n\n\\*    Buzz About Bee
 s: Find out what the bees are doing at this time of year and what you can 
 do to help them. Offered on Saturday\, May 2nd & Sunday\, May 3rd at 11 AM
 .\n\n\\*    Lavender Growing & Processing: Learn about different varieties
  of lavender and how we process it here to make lavender buds\, essential 
 oil\, and hydrosol.\n\n      Offered on Saturday\, May 2nd at 1 PM and Sun
 day\, May 3rd at 1 PM.\n\n\\*   Our Feathered Friends: Meet the chickens\,
  ducks\, and geese and find out what they do on the farm. Offered on Satur
 day\, May 2nd at 11 AM and on Sunday\, May 3rd at 11 AM. \n\nTours are $5 
 per person\, including kids.
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://www.farmtrails.org/event/spring-farm-trails-bees-n-blooms/2026
 -05-03/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:INTO THE LIGHT: Light-filled aintings by Katy Boggs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T170000
UID:260501X5nCnhBfPkaNBgNT0FHZdQ
DESCRIPTION:Katy's paintings are an exploration of light—how it shapes f
 orm\, reveals color\, and defines what we see.\n\n"I am drawn to moments w
 here light is felt as much as seen: filtering through dense leaves\, tower
 ing in the crowns of trees\, glinting off cresting waves\, or softening in
 to the quiet glow of a sunset. Light is everywhere\; without it\, there is
  no seeing. Beyond its physical presence\, it also carries a deeper resona
 nce as a symbol of hope. In a time of uncertainty\, this work seeks to bri
 ng light into the image\, both visually and metaphorically."\n\nReception:
  April 25\, 4 to 6 pm.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Gallery
URL:http://sebastopolgallery.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
