UID:260428UTOYCMyutk-cBBblceUCQg
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something fun and meaningful to do in Petaluma? Fu
 ture Fest is back on May 3 \\(12-4 PM\\)\, and it’s FREE!\n\nFuture Fest
  is an annual green resources expo that features hands-on activities and c
 rafting\, food trucks\, and practical ideas for saving energy\, supporting
  local ecosystems\, and taking climate action at home.\n\nYou’ll also fi
 nd a Student Showcase featuring Petaluma classrooms' real-world sustainabi
 lity projects on topics like wildlife protection and restoring local water
 ways.\n\nThe fifth annual Future Fest is open to all\, with Spanish interp
 retation available.
LOCATION:Petaluma Community Center (Club Room)
URL:https://www.coolpetaluma.org/futurefest2026
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
