DESCRIPTION:West Edge Opera’s summer festival in the East Bay attracts 
 audiences of over four-thousand each summer to see three fully staged and 
 orchestrated operas. Featuring early music\, modern opera from the 20th ce
 ntury\, or world premieres of our brightest living composers\, the West Ed
 ge Opera Festival is a celebration of opera with popular and critical succ
 ess.\n\nThis exciting event will be a sneak peek into the line-up for the 
 summer\, with singers from the mainstage  shows presenting highlights\, 
 excerpts and beloved favorites\, along with a narrative guide of what to l
 ook for in each piece. View full program online.\n\n- Sponsored by Kate a
 nd Dennis Abbe -\n\n- Opera - Programmed by Caroline Altman -
