BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Explore the Art of Flower Printing at h2hotel
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T160000
UID:260425_q37dy4PkE6wDO8J6hF-6Q
DESCRIPTION:Led by Lisa Rogers\, owner of **SlowDigz\,** h2hotel’s Fl
 ower Printing Workshop will introduce participants to the art of flower p
 rinting on silk\, using dried and pressed dye flowers to create a one-of-a
 -kind neckerchief or bandana. \n\nDuring the two-hour session\, attendees
  will explore Tataki Zome\, the technique of hammering fresh botanicals o
 nto fabric\, and the fundamentals of mordanting and scouring\, essential t
 echniques for those interested in further exploring natural dyes. Guests w
 ill also enjoy a selection of wines and light bites\, making this an ide
 al afternoon of artistic exploration and relaxation. \n\nThe event includ
 es all necessary materials\, personal instruction by Lisa Rogers\, and win
 e and light bites.
LOCATION:h2hotel’s Green Room
URL:https://h2hotel.com/experiences/?id=5&venue=h2
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
