BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Napa Bikefest
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260503T150000
UID:260331pG1cxA3_X06EIUFL5j07sA
DESCRIPTION:Get stoked for Napa Bikefest 2026! \n\n​Presented by the Na
 pa County Bicycle Coalition\, Napa Valley Transportation Authority\, and P
 G&E\, Napa Bikefest is a free day-long family-friendly community celebrati
 on of all things bike. The event brings together bike enthusiasts from acr
 oss the Bay Area to celebrate life on two wheels and to help those who are
  new to riding get started. Learn more at www.napabikefest.org! \n\n​Bi
 kefest festivities include: \n\n- the North Bay's largest bike swap mee
 t where you can get a great deal on new and used bikes\, parts\, and acce
 ssories \n\n- awesome music by the Napa High Jazz Band and DJ Rotten Robb
 ie \n\n- a kids bike rodeo & Passport to Bikefest program\, through w
 hich kids can win awesome prizes! \n\n- great food\, beer and wine offe
 rings \n\n- community and bike industry booths \n\n- bike contests and g
 ames for all ages - with prizes! \n\n- Ask-A-Bike Mechanic booth \n\n- S
 tretching for Bicyclists led by Julia Salvador\, DPT of American Canyon Bi
 ke Shop \n\n- bike & helmet decorating station \n\n- free group bike rid
 es\, the Kidical Mass Ride and two pace group options for the Vine Trail
  Month of Movement Ride \n\n​Admission is free\, event runs 9:00am–3:
 00pm in NEW LOCATION Oxbow Commons Park on McKinstry Street in Napa. Easil
 y accessible from the Napa Valley Vine Trail and River Trail. \n\n​See 
 www.napabikefest.org for more info - details are being published as they a
 re confirmed\, so keep checking back for updates! See you there!
LOCATION:Oxbow Commons Park
URL:http://www.napabikefest.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
