DESCRIPTION:Raise Your Voice\, Raise Your Vibration!  Join us in a circle 
 of simple\, uplifting songs designed to anchor empowering truths in your m
 ind and heart—reminding you of who you truly are. Together\, we’ll bui
 ld connection\, elevate our vibration\, and transform our thinking through
  the power of music. Love to sing or curious to experience the power of af
 firmative songs? Come as you are—no musical experience needed! Whether y
 ou sing often or haven't sung before\, this circle is for everyone. ✨ Ev
 ent Details: When: First Thursday of each month\, 6:00-7:30 PM Where: The 
 Social Hall @ Center for Spiritual Living Santa Rosa 2075 Occidental Road\
 , Santa Rosa\, CA 95401 Who: Family-friendly and open to all skill levels 
 Contribution: Supported by love donations \\($10-$20 suggested\\) Let’s 
 create something beautiful together by raising our voices and raising our 
 vibration. I’d love for you to join us FIRST THURSDAYS—no need to sign
  up\, just show up and sing with us! Joyfully\, Astra Fox
LOCATION:Center for Spiritual Living Santa Rosa
