BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hayde Bluegrass Orchestra at Brannan Center
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260507T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260507T210000
UID:260415324R8z9BD0y_zYZsdLqjdQ
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Hayde Bluegrass Orchestra at Brannan Center\, N
 orway's breakout bluegrass sensation. This eight-piece ensemble blends App
 alachian roots with Celtic and Norwegian fiddle influences\, delivering hi
 gh-energy originals and heartfelt ballads. Hailed internationally for thei
 r virtuosity and rich vocals\, they've earned IBMA Momentum Awards\, a Nor
 wegian Grammy nomination for Migrants\, and millions of streams worldwide.
  Inspired by the film The Broken Circle Breakdown\, the band has grown int
 o a global phenomenon\, praised as "the impossible dream of what Norwegian
  musicians can achieve" by Puls Music Magazine. Don't miss this chance to 
 see one of modern bluegrass's most thrilling acts live\, combining soaring
  harmonies\, driving rhythms\, and unforgettable performances that captiva
 te audiences across the globe.
LOCATION:Brannan Center
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/hayde-bluegrass-orchestra-at-brannan-cent
 er/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
