BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Return to Light: A Spring Wellness Morning
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260508T133000
UID:260422HMy7wDzmiUutgV25_IQsmg
DESCRIPTION:Friday\, March 13th \n\n9:00am – 1:30pm\n\nJoin us for a spa
 cious spring morning designed to help you reset\, reconnect\, and realign.
  Through guided movement and mindful practices\, we’ll tap into the clar
 ity and vitality this season so naturally offers.\n\nThis elevated half-da
 y retreat invites you to pause from your daily routine and settle into the
  serene setting of MacArthur Place Hotel & Spa.\n\nWe’ll begin outdoors 
 with a gentle morning light ritual and grounding practice\, before moving 
 indoors for an energizing\, all-levels Vinyasa mobility flow with sculptin
 g elements lead by Andrea Bogart. After light refreshments\, Jodi McLea
 n will guide us into deep rest with immersive sound healing — creating 
 space to soften\, integrate\, and restore. At noon\, enjoy a stroll throug
 h the blooming property before gathering poolside for a thoughtfully cater
 ed seasonal lunch by Layla at MacArthur Place. The afternoon continues wit
 h guided seasonal journaling — a moment to reflect\, check in\, and conn
 ect with what is quietly blooming within you — before closing in circle 
 with shared intention.\n\nGuests are invited to extend their experience wi
 th access to the pool and whirlpool\, along with a 25% spa discount \\(app
 ointments recommended in advance\\).\n\nA morning to awaken. An afternoon 
 to savor. A season to bloom.\n\nCome as the empowering woman that you are.
  Leave nourished\, clear and open to what wants to grow.\n\nWorkshop atten
 dance is $185 per person and includes Vinyasa Flow\, Sound Bath\, Journali
 ng Sessions & Poolside Lunch
LOCATION:MacArthur Place Sonoma
URL:https://www.macarthurplace.com/event/springwellnessworkshop/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
