DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered why a plant like poison oak would grow 
 wild in California? Hear Emma from Vilda Nature tell a story about humans\
 , poison oak\, and how even this nuisance of a plant can help connect us w
 ith nature. Create a piece of artwork while learning more about how to spo
 t this plant and respect it from a distance. For kids in grades K-6. All m
