BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Awake in the Wild: Coming to our Senses in Nature
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T160000
UID:260430DaEdDZ0zkk22gHlAQ-Czew
DESCRIPTION:with Mark Coleman\n\nCome meditate in the serenity and beauty 
 of the meadows\, trees\, and hills at Spirit Rock. This immersive\, nature
 -based daylong offers potent sensory awareness practices that cultivate in
 sight\, interconnection\, and love—an antidote to the busyness and stres
 s of modern life.\n\nDuring our time together\, you will learn how to medi
 tate outdoors through a variety of practices\, all grounded in a mindful s
 ensory attention which not only deepens insight but also opens the heart t
 o a profound love for the earth and all beings.\n\nThis daylong will suppo
 rt you in developing a contemplative relationship to the earth\, deepening
  your understanding of mindfulness in nature\, knowing yourself as earth\,
  and discovering nature as refuge\, teacher\, and source of wisdom and awa
 kening. Come prepared for moments of awe\, mystery\, stillness\, and unexp
 ected delight as you discover nature’s power to inspire and awaken.
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/awake-in-the-wild-comi
 ng-to-our-senses-in-nature-mc2d26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
