BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Making Lip Balm and Body Scrub with Anna O’Neil at Gold Ridge Or
 ganic Farms
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T104500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T120000
UID:260420-fP5onnsnUSRTNajwPE15w
DESCRIPTION:Join us in our charming Apple Cottage for a beautiful hands-on
  experience at Gold Ridge Organic Farms! Spend 75 minutes learning how to 
 craft your very own lip balm and body scrub using our organic olive oil\, 
 and discover how to select the right essential oils to make each creation 
 uniquely yours. Whether you're treating yourself or looking for a fun and 
 memorable way to celebrate Mother's Day with your mom\, this is the perfec
 t excuse to get creative together!\n\nThe experience includes a scenic rid
 e through the farm on our beloved apple-themed trolley and morning tea —
  plus every participant will take home two lip balms and a jar of their ve
 ry own body scrub as a personal keepsake from a truly special day.\n\nYour
  guide for the morning is Anna O'Neil\, an aromatherapist\, garden enthusi
 ast\, and aspiring folk herbalist with a deep-rooted passion for natural r
 emedies that promote well-being. Growing up in Northern California\, Anna 
 has been drawn to the healing power of nature since childhood\, crafting c
 ulinary creations\, herbal remedies\, and luxurious body products inspired
  by the seasonal bounty of the land. A Reiki and Yoga practitioner\, she i
 s dedicated to guiding others on their wellness journeys and helping them 
 discover what brings them comfort and joy.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/gold-ridge-organic-farms/event/605525/maki
 ng-lip-balm-and-body-scrub-with-anna-oneil
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
