DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T180000
UID:260419LI62zMv1e0KHXNHbAY-4rg
DESCRIPTION:Ahoy\, Yaaarrrrbirds! Pirates are taking over our Coal Shed Br
 ewery\, and we're calling you in to save our booty. Join us for a pirate-t
 hemed pick-up party stacked with carribbean eats\, live sea shanties\, cra
 ft brews \\+ housemade cocktails\, and just the right amount of debauchery
 . Yardbird \\+1 are free\, additional tickets $10 each. Eat\,Drink & Plund
 er Dig into Caribbean and seafood fare\, fresh pints\, and specialty cockt
 ails made in-house. Menu: Caribbean Shrimp: Poached Shrimp\, Tropical Cock
 tail Sauce\, Cucumber\, Cilantro\, Avocado Black Bean & Sweet Corn Empanad
 as: Cilantro Chimichurri & Sweet & Spicy Pepper Jam Caribbean Barbacoa Por
 k Sandwich: Pineapple Slaw\, Smoked Chile Mayo\, Sweet Potato Fries Jamaic
 an Jerk Chicken Skewers or Jerk Tofu: Red Beans & Coconut Rice\, Fried Pla
 ntains\, Mango Salsa Live Music All Afternoon Sea shanties to stomp your b
 oots to. Games on Deck Sail your ship to victory in this season's Yardbird
 Games to earn your spot on the Yardbird Trophy. Dress the Part Costumes ar
 e strongly encouraged. Staff will be fully decked out\, and everyone gets 
 a free eyepatch at the door. Claim Your Spring Haul This is your first cha
 nce to pick-up your Spring Release - grab it after the party! Reserve your
  FREE tickets by May 4th Your first two tickets are included with your Yar
 dbird membership. Need more? Purchase up to two additional tickets for Non
 -yardbird guests for $10 each. \\*Tickets are available exclusively to Yar
 dbird members only. Wanna join the party?Sign-up for our Yardbird Club\, a
 nd grab your free tickets!
LOCATION:Coal Shed Brewery
URL:https://www.mareislandbrewingco.com/events/2026-spring-yardbird-pick-u
 p-party
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kevin Gerzevitz
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T000000
UID:260417ARFyIgB9skmULYwj4i96dw
DESCRIPTION:Kevin Gerzevitz is a professional musician\, composer and teac
 her based in the San Francisco Bay Area. He is a keyboardist\, specializin
 g in piano\, accordion and jazz organ\, and is often performing with The J
 ules Broussard New Orleans Jazz Band\, Vintage Jukebox Orchestra\, the B3B
 4 Organ Jazz Quartet\, as well as The Kevin Gerzevitz Trio. He has a BMA f
 rom the University of Michigan \\(1990\\)\, majoring in Music Theory and G
 erman\, an Orff-Schulwerk Teaching Certification from Mills College \\(200
 5\\)\, and is currently the Music & Movement specialist at Pacific Primary
  School in San Francisco. \n\n​\n\nKevin worked closely in the 90’s wi
 th music producer Mark Needham and talent agent Jeff Saltzman\, along with
  Michael Franti's guitarist Jason Bowman on a recording project called Mem
 ory.Man\, cultivating his songwriting skills and left hand synth bass chop
 s. He has shared the stage with José Feliciano\, Michael Manring\, James 
 Carter\, Sheldon Brown\, Todd Boston\, Silvia Nakkach\, Ed Sarath and Dave
  Liebman.
LOCATION:Arlene Francis Center for Spirit\, Art\, and Politics
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108216132?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Aggressive Monks
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T000000
UID:260416d2fOqaiX9UytchDq_Px73Q
