BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Multimedia Concert and Art Show in Napa - Mother's Day
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260510T170000
UID:260429lpurpBndWUmbVfFp-JFizQ
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Intersection of Art\, Faith and Music featuring
  renowned artist He Qi and composer Allan Robert Petker\n\nInternationally
  acclaimed artist He Qi joins composer Allan Robert Petker for a multimedi
 a art-and-music experience in Napa on Mother's Day\, May 10. Petker will c
 onduct Touch\, his composition inspired by He Qi’s art\, performed by th
 e Napa Methodist Cathedral Choir with orchestra. He Qi’s art will be pro
 jected onscreen to create an immersive\, multisensory program. A post-conc
 ert reception and art exhibition will follow\, with He Qi exhibiting origi
 nal works and prints available for purchase.\n\nHe Qi’s bold use of colo
 r\, embellished forms\, and expressive brushwork blend Chinese folk art wi
 th Western influences spanning the Middle Ages to modernism. His work has 
 been described as “Chagall meets Matisse meets Picasso meets the East.
 ” Allan Petker is a composer and arranger with more than 250 published m
 usical works.\n\nA memorable Mother’s Day gift idea: inspiring music\, a
 rt\, and a reception all in one afternoon.
LOCATION:Napa Methodist Church
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/multimedia-concert-and-
 art-show-in-napa-mother-s-day/18742970/2026-05-10T15
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
