 aturday & Sunday matinee at 2:00pm\n\n\\* Saturday\, May 2nd at 2:00pm is 
 a Pick-Your-Price Performance\, tickets are available on a sliding scale s
 tarting at $10\n\nMusic by Stephen Flaherty\n\nLyrics by Lynn Ahrens\n\nBa
 sed on the Works of Theodor Geisel \\(Dr. Seuss\\)\n\nDirected by Kim Brom
 ley\n\nMusic Direction by Lucas Sherman\n\nChoreography by Karen Miles\n\n
 Featuring: Nelson Brown\, Monica Burrowes\, AJ Correia\, Sara Curtis\, Ale
 x Delzell\, Katie Foster\, Mallory Gold\, Riz Gross\, Michael Hunter\, Ron
  Lam\, Molly Larsen-Shine\, Addie Lowe\, Olivia Manz\, Michelle Pagano\, O
 rion Pudoff\, Peter Rogers\, Ted Smith\, Nicole Stanley\, Tina Traboulsi\,
  Malik Charles D. Wade I and Aliya Webb
LOCATION:Spreckels Center for the Performing Arts
