DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Mother's Day with a special spring piano concert at 
 Jack London State Historic Park in Glen Ellen. Held inside the House of Ha
 ppy Walls museum\, this charming afternoon features members of the Jack Lo
 ndon Piano Club performing lively selections on Charmian London's historic
  1901 Steinway baby grand piano. The music reflects the joy and beauty of 
 the season\, honoring the spirit of gatherings once hosted in the London h
 ome. Light refreshments will be served as guests enjoy an intimate perform
 ance in a unique historic setting. Since 2011\, the Piano Club has support
 ed park operations through its concerts\, raising significant funds while 
 sharing the gift of music with the community. Seating is limited\, and acc
 ess to the performance space is via stairs only. Guests are encouraged to 
 plan accordingly.
