 rmance will be a soulful mix of 60's Motown\, Old School '70s\, Retro '80s
 -90's\, Classic Soul\, and R&B. Bring the whole family to share in an afte
 rnoon of love at Vino Godfather Winery on Mare Island. Top Shelf consists 
