 set of award-winning musicians that can perform smooth jazz to funky soul 
 and everything in between!  Joining Top Shelf is the amazing band Talk of 
 the Town with luscious vocal harmonies\, and lots of songs to warm your mo
 ther's heart! Food: For Mother’s Day an elevated Mother's Day experience
  is being offered! Two options on site for you: Soulful Comfort - Enjoy el
