 r just love the classics\, this is a chance to sing along to upbeat favori
 tes from the Fab Four and celebrate together.\n\nWe'll also be serving mim
 osas for the adults\, making it a fun and easy way to spend a memorable da
 y. Everyone is welcome! \n\n \n\nMother's Day Beatles Sing-alongSunday\, M
 ay 103:00&ndash\;4:00 PMPetaluma Arts Center\n\nLyrics will be provided.
