UID:260502qb8IOje4rUeReCKbCJjTjQ
DESCRIPTION:Stand to attention and prepare to enlist for RuPaul's Drag Rac
 e All Stars and National Miss Comedy Queen Tina Burner's all-new one-woman
  tour of duty\, For the Gays: An Honorable Discharge. Get ready to report 
 for a full-scale homosexual deployment of all-new live singing parodies\, 
 signature mixes\, and high-impact costume reveals. Operating under a stric
 t Don't Ask\, Do Tell policy\, no aspect of gay culture remains classified
 . Broadway\, cinema\, television\, and our entire gay herstory are weaponi
 zed. This high-camp cultural assault is threat level: fabulous. Over and o
 ut the rainbow.\n\n \n\nDoors at Noon\n\nShow at 1\n\nVIP Meet and Greet t
