BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Baseball Mensch: The Marty Lurie Story
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T213000
UID:260429H3I4mizGXkyI6XAE5UCqJw
DESCRIPTION:Baseball Mensch is a love letter to baseball. From the streets
  of Brooklyn to the sun-soaked shores of Miami and the ballparks of San Fr
 ancisco\, the film traces the extraordinary life of Marty Lurie — a Mi
 ami Beach Senior High alum whose voice\, wit\, and wisdom have made him a 
 beloved figure in the world of baseball.\n\nThe film \\(created by local M
 arin filmmakers\\) follows Marty’s remarkable journey: from his improbab
 le start in law\, to his rise as one of Northern California’s most sough
 t-after criminal defense attorneys\, and ultimately\, to his reinvention a
 s one of the most distinctive voices in baseball broadcasting. What began 
 in a humble five-watt high school radio station in Miami blossomed into a 
 fifteen-year run with the San Francisco Giants and a career spent connecti
 ng America’s pastime to the deeper rhythms of life.\n\nBut Baseball Men
 sch is about more than the game—because Marty Lurie is about more than 
 baseball. His story reveals a man devoted to justice\, mentorship\, and th
 e belief that baseball can heal\, unite\, and inspire.\n\nEntertaining\, h
 eartfelt\, and laugh-out-loud funny\, Baseball Mensch: The Marty Lurie St
 ory celebrates a Miami original whose love of the game—and of people—
 reminds us why baseball still matters.
LOCATION:Congregation Rodef Sholom
URL:https://www.rodefsholom.org/event/baseball-mensch-movie-screening-and-
 qa-with-marty-lurie.html#
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
