BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:INTO THE LIGHT: Light-filled aintings by Katy Boggs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260514T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260514T170000
UID:260501YFtuxXcb302XZW-qZWwZOQ
DESCRIPTION:Katy's paintings are an exploration of light—how it shapes f
 orm\, reveals color\, and defines what we see.\n\n"I am drawn to moments w
 here light is felt as much as seen: filtering through dense leaves\, tower
 ing in the crowns of trees\, glinting off cresting waves\, or softening in
 to the quiet glow of a sunset. Light is everywhere\; without it\, there is
  no seeing. Beyond its physical presence\, it also carries a deeper resona
 nce as a symbol of hope. In a time of uncertainty\, this work seeks to bri
 ng light into the image\, both visually and metaphorically."\n\nReception:
  April 25\, 4 to 6 pm.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Gallery
URL:http://sebastopolgallery.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Explore the Art and Science of Belgian Ales with Cuver Brewing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260514T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260514T200000
UID:26042584LB1ZvS_kqqMNgAt_yEQQ
DESCRIPTION:Headline: Beyond the Vine: Explore the Art of Belgian Brewing 
 with Cuver Brewing in Sonoma\n\nJoin Sonoma Home Winemakers on Thursday\,
  May 14th\, for a unique departure from our usual vine and wine focus. Thi
 s evening we’re "brewing up" a special session featuring Hendrik Cuver \
 \(Brewmaster\\) and "Hoppy" Don Mills of Windsor’s Cuver Brewing.\n\nFr
 om the science of Belgian yeast to the art of the hop and grain\, learn ho
 w this family-run team combines "Old World" traditions with North Bay inno
 vation.\n\nWhere: Sonoma Community Center\, Room 110\n\nWhen: Doors 6:30
  PM | Talk 7:00 PM\n\nCost: Free\n\nRSVP: https://www.sonomahomewine.org/c
 alendar\n\nNote: 21\\+ only\; Guests are encouraged to bring a bottle of t
 heir homemade wine or a sampling of their homemade beer for the community 
 tasting.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://www.sonomahomewine.org/calendar
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
