DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260514T090000
UID:260414GMFUvSgrBUec8Cz6Rz09WQ
DESCRIPTION:May is Bike to Wherever Month!\n\nRide your bike in May and he
 lp us celebrate bicycling as a sustainable\, practical and fun way to get 
