 icipate in a host of cycling activities\, events and challenges throughout
  the month of May. Get outside\, save money\, have fun\, and maybe even wi
 n some prizes!\n\nDuring the morning commute on Bike to Work Day\, Thursda
 y\, May 14\, Energizer Stations throughout the County will dispense snacks
 \, swag\, and support. Check our website for a list of Stations as well as
  other events throughout the month.
LOCATION:County-wide
URL:https://www.bikesonoma.org/our-work/btwd-3/
