DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260515T000000
UID:2603221gZKctz_BEGlts_cB5A3vA
DESCRIPTION:Strangelove-The DEPECHE MODE Experience:\n\nHailing from US/UK
 \, the Grammy-nominated allstar producer/artists in Strangelove-The DEPECH
 E MODE Experience deliver a career spanning\, pitch perfect “best of” 
 concert that transports listeners through time and touches on several key 
 points in Depeche Mode’s 40\\+ year career. Songs from throughout the De
 peche canon of 50\\+ chart-topping hits are lovingly recreated\, with the 
 look\, feel and ENERGY of a classic-era DEPECHE MODE arena show. No detail
  of Strangelove’s presentation has been overlooked\; and stage set piece
 s and in-show costume changes reflect different eras of Depeche Mode’s s
 tory.\n\n"They do it to such fine detail it's scary" \\(Martin Gore-Depech
 e Mode\\)\n\n​\n\nSTRANGELOVE ONLINE:\n\nhttps://www.depechetribute.com/
 \n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/strangelovetribute/\n\nhttps://www.instagram.
 com/strangelovetribute/\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/strangelove\n\nhttps://
 twitter.com/depechetribute
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre & Music Hall
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/107917727?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
