SUMMARY:Artazan Handcraft Market
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T170000
UID:260420Z_6YZgyCtU--D7rpPC972w
DESCRIPTION:The Artazan Handcraft Market returns to the Pasadena Conventio
 n Center May 16–17\, bringing together over 200 independent artisans and
  tradespeople for a vibrant weekend celebrating handcrafted work\, creativ
 ity\, and community.\n\nThis thoughtfully curated marketplace features a w
 ide range of work\, from artisan jewelry and hand-thrown ceramics to texti
 les\, fine art\, home décor\, clothing\, and specialty foods. Visitors ca
 n explore\, shop\, and connect directly with the makers\, discovering piec
 es that are both distinctive and thoughtfully made.\n\nA Spring Experience
  to Explore Artazan is more than a marketplace — it’s a full experienc
 e. Guests can enjoy live music throughout the weekend\, take part in hands
 -on workshops\, and sample artisan foods and drinks while exploring the sh
 ow. Whether you're looking for something special or simply spending a day 
 out\, Artazan offers an inspiring and welcoming atmosphere.\n\nInspired by
  the Arts & Crafts Movement Rooted in the ideals of the Arts & Crafts move
 ment\, Artazan celebrates craftsmanship\, natural materials\, and intentio
 nal design. Each exhibitor is carefully selected\, creating a show that hi
 ghlights quality\, originality\, and the story behind the work.\n\nEvent D
 etails Location: Pasadena Convention Center\, 300 E Green St\, Pasadena\, 
 CA Dates: Saturday & Sunday\, May 16–17 Hours: 10 AM – 5 PM both days 
 Admission: $8 online | $10 at the door \\(valid for both days\\)\n\nFor ti
 ckets\, workshop schedules\, and a full list of exhibitors\, visitwww.Arta
 zan.com.
LOCATION:Pasadena Convention Center
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/artazan-handcraft-marke
 t/18631421/2026-05-16T10
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
