  Meadow for an unforgettable afternoon at “Camp Pritchard” at Chappell
 et — a nostalgic celebration of spring’s arrival\, great wine\, and ti
 me well spent together.\n\nThis Spring Release event is our playful nod to
  classic camp days: open skies\, fresh air\, shared laughter\, camp-inspir
 ed bites and games\, and a lively meadow buzzing with camp spirit!\n\nThro
 ughout the afternoon\, earn your “merit badges” as you taste through t
 he wines of our May Wine Club shipment:\n\n2025 Chenin Blanc\n\n2023 Growe
