 r you’re a bingo pro or just in it for the smoke and the laughs\, this i
 s your new favorite Sunday ritual.\n\nWhen: Every Other Sunday\n\nWhere: T
 he Lounge at Mercy\n\nCost: $10 Door Cover | Free Bingo\n\nAge Requirement
 : 21\\+ only\n\nLicensed Venue: DCC \\# C12-0000420-LIC\n\nExpect relaxed 
