BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Walk the High School Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260519T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260519T093000
UID:260502Pom3Ahh0sEGCNkvXOnNNvQ
DESCRIPTION:Parents and their prospective students are invited to experien
 ce a window into Waldorf at the High School level! This tour offers studen
 ts the chance to shadow for a day in the High School \\(8am-3pm\\)\, while
  parents explore the campus on a guided tour \\(8-9:30am\\). Parents will 
 have the opportunity to observe classes\, learn more about the depth of ou
 r experiential\, college-prep curriculum\, explore the beauty of our campu
 s and programs\, meet faculty\, school leaders and current parents\, and h
 ave a Q&A with our HS Counselor\, current students\, and Admissions Dire
 ctor.\n\nLunch: Your shadowing student is invited to enjoy a delicious\, c
 omplimentary lunch as part of our Shadow Day! Our farm-to-table lunch prog
 ram features fresh ingredients from our farm and includes gluten-free\, da
 iry-free\, and vegetarian options. If you prefer\, you’re welcome to bri
 ng your own lunch. \n\nRSVP required\, please register at the link provid
 ed.
LOCATION:Summerfield Waldorf School & Farm
URL:https://www.summerfieldwaldorf.org/visit
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
