  as well as all day access to the 90-94° hot spring-fed mineral pools\, c
 reek\, and grounds\, plus a 10% café discount — an invitation to move\,
  soak\, and unwind at your own pace.\n\nSoak In The Day Pass: $49 per pers
 on Includes: • Any **two (2) Guided Water Practices** (any adult class
 es that day) • **10% discount at our farm-to-table organic Café 108** 
 • **Full-day access** to 90-94° hot spring pools\, creek & grounds\n\
 n**MORE INFO:** *https://mortonswarmsprings.com/wellness-and-programs*\n\n
 **RESERVE YOUR SPOT:** *https://tinyurl.com/adult-class-reg*
LOCATION:Morton's Warm Springs
URL:https://mortonswarmsprings.com/adult-classes/
