DESCRIPTION:A PRIVATE EVENING WITH MT. JOY UNDER THE NAPA STARSDestination
  Defender returns to Napa Valley for one unforgettable night on Thursday\,
  May 21 at Silver Oak\, overlooking the vineyards. Join us under the Napa 
 sky for a private evening that pairs a curated culinary and wine experienc
 e with an intimate Mt. Joy performance.MORE THAN A SHOW. THIS ALL-IN EXPER
 IENCE INCLUDES:• A private\, stripped-down Mt. Joy performance in a clos
 e setting\, designed for fans who want to be as near to the music as possi
 ble.• A thoughtfully crafted culinary experience from a celebrated chef\
 , designed to complement the evening’s atmosphere and sound.• Award wi
 nning Silver Oak & Twomey wines throughout the evening.• Immersive momen
 ts that elevate the night into a true Destination Defender experienceDon
 ’t miss your chance to experience Mt. Joy the way few ever will—up clo
 se and under the Napa sky.Early access is now live. Reserve your seat whil
 e availability lasts.-----IMPORTANT NOTICE: While supplies last. Tickets a
 re non-transferable and non-refundable. Reselling ticket is strictly prohi
 bited. Destination Defender Music Experience at BottleRock is a 21\\+ only
  event. Valid I.D. required at time of check-in. Event time\, Date\, Detai
 ls\, & Price are subject to change.TICKET POLICY: The holder of this ticke
 t is granted admission to the indicated facility for the purpose of viewin
 g the specified event. This ticket is for use by the holder only and the h
 older is bound by this policy. This ticket is not transferable and may not
  be sold\, otherwise conveyed\, or used for any other purpose\, including 
 promotion or commercial\, without the prior written consent of Jaguar Land
  Rover North America\, LLC and Live Nation Worldwide\, Inc. If this ticket
  is sold\, otherwise conveyed\, or used in violation of this policy\, it w
 ill be deemed revoked and void\, and its holder deemed a trespasser at the
  Destination Defender Music Experience at BottleRock event. This ticket is
  a revocable license\, and admission may be refused\, or ejection may occu
 r for failure to comply with any facility rule. The holder agrees not to t
 ransmit or aid in transmitting any description\, picture\, recording or re
 production of the event. The holder acknowledges that the event may be cap
 tured and recorded by audio\, audiovisual\, and/or photographic means\, an
 d hereby grants permission to utilize the holder’s image and/or voice in
  any and all media now known or hereafter devised to further the interests
  and mission of Jaguar Land Rover North America\, LLC and Live Nation Worl
 dwide\, Inc. It is unlawful to reproduce this ticket in any form. The Hold
 er assumes all risks incidental to the event\, whether occurring prior to\
 , during or after the event\, and releases the facility\, management\, all
  participants and each of their affiliates\, employees\, officers\, direct
 ors\, members\, partners\, owners\, managers\, sponsors\, contractors and 
 agents from any loss\, damage or expense resulting from any such risk. Jag
 uar Land Rover North America\, LLC and Live Nation Worldwide\, Inc. reserv
 e all legal rights and remedies.-----Inquiries may be sent to Destination 
 Defender Music at DestinationDefenderMusic\\(at\\)livenation.com.
