UID:260419MGaQZ6Nx10ipz5FjOo7jIg
DESCRIPTION:Prepare for an explosive night of rhythm and soul as Barrio Fu
 nk takes the stage! Bringing a heavy dose of Latin-infused grease and high
 -octane energy\, this ensemble is dedicated to keeping the dance floor pac
