 Goodbye\, Eri by Tatsuki Fujimoto February 24 - Snow and Ink vol.1 by Miyu
 ki Unohana \\*March 24 - Orange vol.1 by Ichigo Takano April 28 - Witch Ha
 t Atelier vol.1 by Kamome Shirahama May 26 - Mao vol.1 by Rumiko Takahashi
