BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The LushCattPark Band (Grateful Dead Tribute) Downtown Santa Rosa
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T213000
UID:260502Gy_dA1SE2U-OTSwYb7zrlQ
DESCRIPTION:The LushCattPark Band brings the spirit of the Grateful Dead t
 o Downtown Santa Rosa with a night of live jam band magic.\n\nFeaturing Ja
 mie Parker (guitar)\, Rob Catterton (piano)\, and Chris Lushington (bass)\
 , this trio blends expressive lead guitar\, shimmering piano lines\, and a
  deep melodic groove that captures the essence of the Dead while keeping t
 hings fresh and alive.\n\nStart your night early with the Collaboration Ja
 zz Band from 5–7pm\, then settle in for two sets of jam band heaven from
  7–9:30pm.\n\nFree show. Good people. Downtown energy.\n\n Barrel Proof
  Lounge 501 Mendocino Avenue\, Downtown Santa Rosa  21+ | Beer\, wine & S
 oju cocktails\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts o
 f good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://LushCattPark.eventbrite.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
